OL,3,GNEWSAFour new mobile police stations   
OL,4,Ahit the road                           
OL,6,FFour mobile police stations are up and 
OL,7,Frunning across Hampshire and the Isle  
OL,8,Fof Wight.                              
OL,10,FStaffed by Neighbourhood Policing Teams
OL,11,Fand local officers they will visit     
OL,12,Fcommunities and rural areas where it's 
OL,13,Fnot as easy for people to get to a     
OL,14,Fpolice station or front counter.       
OL,16,FThe vans have been funded by Police and
OL,17,FCrime Commissioner (PCC) Donna Jones.  
OL,18,FShe said the mobile police stations    
OL,19,Fwould be taken to market days, High    
OL,20,FStreets and community events to "bring 
OL,21,Fthe police into the heart of local     
OL,22,Fcommunities".                          
